<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ATC Comm said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ATC Comm said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co downgraded ATC Communications Inc to market perform from buy, according to an Oppenheimer source.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at 10-1/2 on Thursday.</p>
